          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(docker_container_net_rx_bytes[$__rate_interval])) + sum(rate(docker_container_net_tx_bytes[$__rate_interval]))"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Combined in and out across all containers. From the Docker API, not the host NIC: node-exporter reads /proc/net from its own network namespace, so host interface counters are not available without host networking.",
      "id": 202
